        {"zh": "金属的味道真香。", "en": "Metal smells delicious."},
        {"zh": "把扳手递上来。", "en": "Hand the wrench up here."},
        {"zh": "油罐，递到我手上。", "en": "An oil can. Give it here."},
        {"zh": "你需要什么交换？", "en": "What do you want in trade?"},
        {"zh": "别拿走，那还有用。", "en": "Don't take it. It's useful."}
